sd":null},{"k":"71:19","t":"And Allāh has made for you the earth an expanse","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"71:20","t":"That you may follow therein roads of passage.'\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"71:21","t":"Noah said, \"My Lord, indeed they have disobeyed me and followed him whose wealth and children will not increase him except in loss.","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"71:22","t":"And they conspired an immense conspiracy","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"71:23","t":"And said, 'Never leave your gods and never leave Wadd or Suwāʿ or Yaghūth and Yaʿūq and Nasr.'","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"71:24","t":"And already they have misled many. And, [my Lord], do not increase the wrongdoers except in error.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"71:25","t":"Because of their sins they were drowned and put into the Fire, and they found not for themselves besides Allāh [any] helpers.","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"71:26","t":"And Noah said, \"My Lord, do not leave upon the earth from among the disbelievers an inhabitant.","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":26,"sd":null},{"k":"71:27","t":"Indeed, if You leave them, they will mislead Your servants and not beget except [every] wicked one and [confirmed] disbeliever.","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":27,"sd":null},{"k":"71:28","t":"My Lord, forgive me and my parents and whoever enters my house a believer and the believing men and believing women. And do not increase the wrongdoers except in destruction.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":71,"a":28,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":57,"surahs":[71],"sajdah":false}